menu "Demo display"

config DEMO_TOUCH_POINTERS
    int "Touch pointer count"
    range 1 ESP_LCD_TOUCH_MAX_POINTS if ESP_LCD_TOUCH_MAX_POINTS < 5
    range 1 5
    default 5
    help
        Number of touch pointers exposed to LVGL. One uses single-touch
        mode; larger values use multi-control mode. Simultaneous contacts
        also depend on the touch controller's capabilities.

endmenu
